[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0010","text":"呼————……\n哈——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0020","text":"我……曾经是个偶像——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0030","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0040","text":"——有一个我非常喜欢的偶像，\n我模仿她跳舞的样子，家人都很喜欢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0050","text":"……有一台小小的玩具键盘，\n里面存着那首歌，大家也经常一起唱……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0060","text":"想变成那时候那样——\n我可能是这么想的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0070","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0080","text":"……我明白的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0090","text":"……诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0100","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0120","text":"我去练习了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0130","text":"不需要，搞好关系"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0140","text":"日花，要幸福啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0150","text":"————或许能做到"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0160","text":"就像以前一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_04_0170","text":"……我是这么想的。那一刻，一瞬间"}]
